note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note contract 5 fresh, line 120: N = 64 is the upper bound and is accepted; 4 line 87: unroll 64.
note stdout: len 64, then 1+..+64 = 2080 (oracle exp/f5-n64.out).
om2
fn f s edit uchar 64 fresh to ulong
for i ulong 64 unroll
put s i uchar add i 1
end
t = ulong 0
for j ulong 64
t = add t ulong get s j
end
putd len s
ret t
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 64 0
putd f a
ret 0
end
